" none; } }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"game\"></canvas>\n<div id=\"loading\">Powder Run<small>preparo la montagna\u2026</",
"small></div>\n<div id=\"vig\"></div><div id=\"speedfx\"></div><div id=\"flash\"></div>\n\n<div id=\"hud\" class=\"hidden\">\n  <div cl",
"ass=\"tl\">\n    <div id=\"score\">0</div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><div id=\"lives\"></div><span id=\"modeLbl\">Free Run</span></div",
">\n    <div id=\"goal\" class=\"hidden\"><b>Sfida</b><span id=\"goalTxt\"></span><div class=\"bar\"><i id=\"goalBar\"></i></div></d",
"iv>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"comboBox\"><div id=\"comboVal\">0</div><div id=\"comboTimer\"><i id=\"comboT\"></i></div><div id=\"combo",
"List\"></div></div>\n  <div class=\"tr\">\n    <div class=\"meta\"><b id=\"spd\">0</b><span>km/h</span><span id=\"dst\">0 m</span><",
"/div>\n    <button class=\"icon\" id=\"btnCam\" aria-label=\"Cambia camera\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"curre",
"ntColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 8h3l2-2.5h6L17 8h3v11H4z\"/><circle ",
"cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3.5\"/></svg></button>\n    <button class=\"icon\" id=\"btnPause\" aria-label=\"Pausa\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 ",
"24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"5\" width=\"4\" height=\"14\" rx=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"5\" width=\"4\" height=\"14\" rx=\"1",
".2\"/></svg></button>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"live\"></div>\n  <button id=\"btnReplay\" class=\"hidden\">\u25b6 Replay</button>\n  <div i",
"d=\"pops\"></div>\n  <div id=\"hint\"></div>\n  <div id=\"railBal\">sul rail: \u2190 \u2192 cambia trick \u00b7 trascina \u2191 \u2193 press \u00b7 tocca per ",
"saltare</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"controls\" class=\"hidden\">\n  <div id=\"stickHome\">Sterza</div>\n  <div id=\"stickBase\"><div id",
"=\"stickKnob\"></div></div>\n  <div id=\"act\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 112 112\"><circle class=\"ring\" cx=\"56\" cy=\"56\" r=\"52\"/><circl",
"e class=\"chg\" id=\"chg\" cx=\"56\" cy=\"56\" r=\"52\"/></svg><div class=\"lb\" id=\"actLbl\">Salta<small>tieni e lascia</small></div",
"></div>\n  <div id=\"compass\"><div class=\"c\"></div></div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"menu\" class=\"overlay hidden\">\n  <div class=\"car",
"d\">\n    <div class=\"menuGrid\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"logo\"><span>Powder</span><span>Run</span><small>FREE RIDE",
" \u00b7 SNOWPARK INFINITO</small></div>\n        <p class=\"sub\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" id=\"menuRec\">Record: 0</p>\n      </div",
">\n      <div class=\"modes\">\n        <button class=\"mode main\" data-mode=\"free\"><b>Free Run</b><span>Salti e rail all'inf",
